'''Atziri's Promise''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Amethyst Flask}}.

__TOC__

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 4.50 seconds instead.

